            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About this Game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comit the Astrodian 3 is the follow-up to 2017's Comit the Astrodian 2. It features new stages, new allies, and a new villain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil Cosmo Knight has unleashed the droid army. Comit must help his new friend Jupi stop the knight and save the galaxy once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comit's Abilities: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comit's rocket allows him to boost through stages at high speed as well as pull off feats like double jumping and bouncing off of certain enemies. His new abilities will include swinging, sliding and the addition of power-ups. Bonus Stages will now hold the key to unlocking Meta Comit.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About this Game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comit the Astrodian 3 is the follow-up to 2017's Comit the Astrodian 2. It features new stages, new allies, and a new villain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil Cosmo Knight has unleashed the droid army. Comit must help his new friend Jupi stop the knight and save the galaxy once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comit's Abilities: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comit's rocket allows him to boost through stages at high speed as well as pull off feats like double jumping and bouncing off of certain enemies. His new abilities will include swinging, sliding and the addition of power-ups. Bonus Stages will now hold the key to unlocking Meta Comit.</p>",
            "short_description": "Comit returns in Comit the Astrodian 3. This game features new stages, new allies and a new villain, Cosmo Knight.",
